# New durable-execution records generated since the flagship project's last
# commit. Its 182 committed files (stage JSONs, assets, export media, and the
# already-tracked production-execution records) stay tracked; only the ~280
# uncommitted production-execution/*.json written since are ignored here.
/data/projects/fatih-sultan-mehmet-in-i-stanbul-un-fethine-hazirlanisi-cfe77fd8-8350-4415-bc87-211e3d36c4d5/production-execution/
